    "CameraContinuousProjection.AngularProjectionPreservesGeometricZerosForDetectorOffsets": "ThinLens4x2/FOV2/focus50, film(.5,.5),pupil(.2,.7). Exact angular Jacobian p[1][1]=0 and nonzero determinant; invert original sigma=(2*pi/180)/2*.3 offsets for z=(4,0),(0,4), both projections represented.",
